     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各為前輩好:<div><br></div><div>以下是兩個表單的圖<br><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fCKsUygIqAs/WVHUDKH5kbI/AAAAAAAAUzU/k_F1x-Zfz4I8K-uQzrIfCEw2imy2Uux-gCLcBGAs/s1600/1498534669665.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fCKsUygIqAs/WVHUDKH5kbI/AAAAAAAAUzU/k_F1x-Zfz4I8K-uQzrIfCEw2imy2Uux-gCLcBGAs/s1600/1498534669665.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237624466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1X-wOer9QlB6f2JFPKt4co\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fCKsUygIqAs/WVHUDKH5kbI/AAAAAAAAUzU/k_F1x-Zfz4I8K-uQzrIfCEw2imy2Uux-gCLcBGAs/s320/1498534669665.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"89\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-woETdRjQ5hQ/WVHUHsliJbI/AAAAAAAAUzY/QqsV5e6NFogxekTZkfzGYMA-L5qmtJnYQCLcBGAs/s1600/1498534700821.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-woETdRjQ5hQ/WVHUHsliJbI/AAAAAAAAUzY/QqsV5e6NFogxekTZkfzGYMA-L5qmtJnYQCLcBGAs/s1600/1498534700821.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237624466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qyhi-Lfoenbc8TbgUQCzL\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-woETdRjQ5hQ/WVHUHsliJbI/AAAAAAAAUzY/QqsV5e6NFogxekTZkfzGYMA-L5qmtJnYQCLcBGAs/s320/1498534700821.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"113\"></a></p><div>目前遇到一個問題，想在迴圈中比對幾個表單，以表單中Date_Month欄位為篩選條件，針對連續2個月才出現的詞才留下輸出，想請問該如何建立呢?</div><div><br></div><div>懇請協助，感激不盡<br><br><br><br><br></div></div></div>"
