     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi David,<div><br></div><div>參考以下使用 diff, lapply 說明, diff 可比較數列之相減結果, 如果某個keyword之yyyymm相減結果為1,表示相鄰年月有連續出現.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w3RelG9fFZk/WVhSLnJzjYI/AAAAAAAALrU/-kf0Cdv1aLIdznWc2JN1sOgA1__inGP6gCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E9%2580%25A3%25E7%25BA%258C2%25E5%2580%258B%25E6%259C%2588%25E5%2587%25BA%25E7%258F%25BE%25E7%259B%25B8%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%2580%25BC.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w3RelG9fFZk/WVhSLnJzjYI/AAAAAAAALrU/-kf0Cdv1aLIdznWc2JN1sOgA1__inGP6gCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E9%252580%2525A3%2525E7%2525BA%25258C2%2525E5%252580%25258B%2525E6%25259C%252588%2525E5%252587%2525BA%2525E7%25258F%2525BE%2525E7%25259B%2525B8%2525E5%252590%25258C%2525E5%252580%2525BC.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237624472000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fDwgvJaOc2BfUlIyiHFn-\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-w3RelG9fFZk/WVhSLnJzjYI/AAAAAAAALrU/-kf0Cdv1aLIdznWc2JN1sOgA1__inGP6gCLcBGAs/s400/%25E9%2580%25A3%25E7%25BA%258C2%25E5%2580%258B%25E6%259C%2588%25E5%2587%25BA%25E7%258F%25BE%25E7%259B%25B8%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%2580%25BC.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"368\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 連續2個月出現相同值</div><div># date: 2017.07.1</div><div><br></div><div># 步驟1 建立模擬資料</div><div>set.seed(168)</div><div>sampleSize &lt;- 20</div><div>CreateDate &lt;- seq.Date(from=as.Date(&quot;2017/6/1&quot;), to=as.Date(&quot;2017/10/1&quot;), length.out=sampleSize)</div><div>keyword &lt;- sample(LETTERS[1:15], sampleSize, replace=TRUE)</div><div>mydata &lt;- data.frame(keyword, CreateDate, stringsAsFactors=FALSE)</div><div>mydata$yyyymm &lt;- as.numeric(paste0(format(mydata$CreateDate, &quot;%Y&quot;),format(mydata$CreateDate, &quot;%m&quot;)))</div><div><br></div><div># 步驟2 計算出現大於或等於2次以上之keyword為候選關鍵字</div><div>keywordCandidate &lt;- names(table(mydata$keyword))[table(mydata$keyword) &gt;= 2]</div><div># [1] &quot;E&quot; &quot;I&quot; &quot;L&quot; &quot;M&quot; &quot;N&quot; &quot;O&quot;</div><div><br></div><div># 步驟3 依照keyword, yyyymm 排序</div><div># 觀察結果顯示 E(8,9月), L(7,8月) 為連續2個月出現</div><div>(mytest &lt;- mydata[order(mydata$keyword, mydata$yyyymm),])</div><div><br></div><div># 使用diff測試</div><div>x &lt;- mytest[mytest$keyword == &quot;E&quot;,]</div><div>any(diff(x$yyyymm) == 1) # TRUE</div><div><br></div><div># 步驟4 將測試步驟以lapply函數實做</div><div># diff等於1,表示連續2個月出現相同值</div><div>ind &lt;- unlist(lapply(keywordCandidate, function(x) {</div><div>  tmp &lt;- mytest[mytest$keyword == x,]</div><div>  any(diff(tmp$yyyymm) == 1)</div><div>}))</div><div>ind</div><div>keywordCandidate[ind]</div><div># [1] &quot;E&quot; &quot;L&quot;</div><div># ends</div></font></div></code></div><br>David於 2017年6月27日星期二 UTC+8上午11時43分39秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
